    "ordinal_rule": "SeedManager.init_eval sorts <task>_<n>.json numerically; the 55 files are numbered 0-54 without a gap, so ordinal n is <task>_<n>.json"
  },
  "decision": "User decision 2026-10-01 (operator-approved survey): EXP11A g008 second cell, a three-round session (K = 3 rounds) with a new layout per round. This appendix extends the put_bottles_into_dustbin review-v2 record from layout 0 to the reviewed pool 17, 2, 25 and the fallback 21 without changing its contract text, and binds the bottle-model metadata the evaluator reads in each. Layout 28, first scheduled third, was dropped after the 2026-10-01 scene smoke found its standing bottle/50 unreachable.",
  "criteria": [
    "Instruction: gen_instruction (task/RoboDojo/tasks/put_bottles_into_dustbin.py) returns the constant template \"Pick up the bottles and throw them into the dustbin, using handover when needed.\" with no label placeholder, so every layout delivers the reviewed instruction; the worker refuses a round whose upstream instruction differs from round 0.",
    "Objects: every audited layout has exactly the four Rigid instances bottle0-bottle3 that run_reward names and no other Rigid category; the dustbin (Geometry category 0) stands at (-0.63, -0.10, 0.40) with identity orientation and every fixture section (Geometry, Room, Table, Ground, Background) is JSON-equal to the reviewed layout 0.",
    "Contract text: review-v2 states nothing about bottle positions, poses or models, so its sentences state the same requirements for every audited layout; standing bottles spawn upright and lying ones on their side (tilt within 1 degree of 0 or 90).",
    "Evaluator assets: is_A_on_B_bottom reads each bottle's metadata oriented bounding box. The record binds the layout-0 models (41, 60, 25, 22); each row binds the metadata bytes of its own four models in evaluator_asset_dependencies, which RunSpec resolution discloses and fresh preflight re-hashes (fail closed).",
    "Comparability: layout 0 holds bottle/22, whose layout physics mass 22 is clamped to 0.5 kg at load (asset metadata 0.22 kg); no audited pool layout contains bottle/22, so earlier put_bottles results on layout 0 are not same-condition comparable with these rounds.",
    "Spawn note: in layout 25 the standing bottle/0 (aligned box 0.245 m tall, centre z 0.88) starts about 7.5 mm into the table top at z 0.765; the contract text is unaffected.",
    "Not a reachability review: arm reach and the right-table-edge knock-off risk are decided by the catalog review and the scene smoke."
  ],
